              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I adjusted this martini to use pumpkin spice liquor and skipped the step with the honey/graham crackers. (Didn't sound good to me at all.) I did dip the martini and glass in honey, only I dipped the honey coated glass in a mixture of pumpkin pie spice and sugar.\nThis is something you really need to shake up good with a lot of ice in your shaker. It's most definitely better ice cold."
          },
          {
