              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Teresa G"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought this was pretty tasty. I used pumpkin spice milk and toasted marshmallow vodka because I didn't have vanilla vodka on hand. I also didn't have any honey so I used agave nectar and graham cracker crumbs for the rim. I will be serving this to friends over the holidays!",
